#: ../../source/docs/common-powermodule-landingpage.rst:59
#: 68b6ca3a2ec94f92800e7e5d0e467561
msgid "A DroneCAN based Battery Tag which monitors battery age and user cycles can be easily created by reflashing the `Matek DroneCAN RC adapter board <https://www.mateksys.com/?portfolio=can-l4-rc>`__ using the `Battery Tag AP_Periph firmware <https://firmware.ardupilot.org/AP_Periph/latest/MatekL431-BatteryTag/>`__ . Firmware updating process is explained :ref:`HERE <dronecan-firmware-flashing>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-powermodule-landingpage.rst:61
#: b3fa71758a7f45a1bc8f3ea79129ed3a
msgid "VimDrones also has Battery Tag firmware for use with their DroneCan devices based on the L431, `HERE <https://firmware.ardupilot.org/AP_Periph/latest/VM-L431-BatteryTag/>`__."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-powermodule-landingpage.rst:63
#: 049bf917bdf94e1b97f6f3df021f491f
msgid "Battery Tag data can be accessed easily via either examining the tag's DroneCAN parameters using the :ref:`GCS DroneCAN Interface <dronecan-uavcan-slcan>` or :ref:`DroneCAN GUI <common-uavcan-gui>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-powermodule-landingpage.rst:65
#: 5493892a62924e13b8ebb3e3f4419adc
msgid "A `Scripting applet <https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/AP_Scripting/applets/BatteryTag.lua>`__ can also be used."
msgstr ""

